            "evidence": [
              "The SessionStart spec is appended last in projectionFamily (engine/settings/projection.go). removeHooks now scans SessionStart (engine/settings/merge.go), so uninstall removes the new entry. Uninstall is covered by TestUninstall_RemovesOnlyTheProjectionFamilyWhenTheRestIsGone, which now includes SessionStart and a foreign entry.",
              "Upgrade from an older install is covered. TestInstall_AddsTheMemoryReadMatchersToAnInstallThatPredatesThem asserts that the missing part 'SessionStart projection hook' is reported last, and then that Install completes the family.",
              "The status label change in engine/status/status.go is mirrored in status_test.go, status_command_test.go and every golden file. The reported missing-parts list in the settings-without-hooks golden now ends with the SessionStart entry, which matches the family order.",
              "Minor and unproved: startsFromAnInstallBeforeTheMemoryReadMatchers in engine/settings/settingsfile/golden_unix_test.go now returns true for any case whose text lacks the SessionStart command. That skips replay of those recorded cases. The candidate does not show how many cases this affects, so I am not reporting it as a finding."
